<section id="introduction" class="introduction section-pad light-section">
  <SectionHeading number="01" label="THE PHILOSOPHY"/>
  <div class="intro-layout"><div class="intro-image"><Image src={detail} alt="A detailer carefully machine-polishing a vehicle panel" widths={[480, 800, 1100]} sizes="(max-width: 700px) 90vw, 42vw" format="webp" quality={78} loading="lazy"/><span class="image-note">THE WORK IS IN THE PREPARATION.</span></div><div class="intro-copy"><h2>MORE THAN<br/>A CLEAN<br/><span class="muted-heading">FINISH.</span></h2><p>Machine polishing. Careful preparation. Protection applied with patience. This is the work behind paint that looks its best.</p><p class="muted-copy">THE FINISH imagines a dedicated detailing studio where every panel is inspected, corrected and cared for by hand — with clear attention to the process as well as the result.</p><a href="#process" class="text-link">Discover the approach <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><span class="small-note">A FICTIONAL STUDIO. A STUDY IN CRAFT.</span></div></div>
</section>
